WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:32.458
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.166
about His divine nature

3
00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:36.625
shared some foundational truths.

4
00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:39.291
Now in this verse too He explains

5
00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:42.500
why this knowledge is so special.

6
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Until Lord Krishna Himself explains it,

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.666
for anyone else

8
00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:50.875
to reach this knowledge is impossible.

9
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.750
Lord Krishna, while speaking
about His divine form,

10
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.375
makes this clear

11
00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:58.000
that even for the devas and the maharishis

12
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.916
His origin and glory to fully understand

13
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:03.625
is impossible.

14
00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:06.833
He declares that He Himself is the original

15
00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.458
source of all of them.

16
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.791
In this verse,

17
00:01:15.791 --> 00:01:16.791
Lord Krishna

18
00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:19.333
while explaining His transcendental form,

19
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:21.958
He reveals, the unique
challenge of understanding.

20
00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:23.625
The devas, who are in the material

21
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.583
realm extremely powerful beings,

22
00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:29.541
and the maharishis, who are detached

23
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.666
and possess deep spiritual experience,

24
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:34.708
even they Lord Krishna's origin

25
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:38.166
or glory cannot fully understand.

26
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:39.583
This is because

27
00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:42.541
Lord Krishna is their supreme source –

28
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:44.250
of their existence and powers

29
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.125
the original cause.

30
00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:49.416
Just as a child cannot fully understand

31
00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:52.541
the origin or nature of their parents,

32
00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:54.416
in the same way the devas and rishis

33
00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:56.458
Lord Krishna's position

34
00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:59.500
without His grace cannot understand.

35
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.500
In this verse, Lord Krishna reveals

36
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.500
how pointless it is to guess

37
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.166
at the truth of His real nature.

38
00:02:08.166 --> 00:02:10.375
Through mere speculation, Lord Krishna's

39
00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:13.708
knowledge to gain is pointless.

40
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:14.375
This kind of

41
00:02:14.375 --> 00:02:16.916
mental speculation, even the scholarship gained from it

42
00:02:16.916 --> 00:02:18.666
and intense tapasya,

43
00:02:18.666 --> 00:02:22.291
even these cannot reveal
the knowledge of Lord Krishna.

44
00:02:22.291 --> 00:02:24.958
Only through Lord Krishna's grace

45
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:25.833
does His divine

46
00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:29.000
glory begin to be understood,

47
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.041
by those who in devotion seek His shelter.

48
00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:35.458
Lord Krishna's this declaration

49
00:02:35.458 --> 00:02:39.041
also serves to inspire Arjun.

50
00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:40.500
Lord Krishna says

51
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.833
that even the greatest

52
00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:43.125
beings cannot receive

53
00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:44.458
the teaching

54
00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:46.958
that Arjun has received.

55
00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:48.500
Arjun has received this teaching

56
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.291
as a special privilege

57
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:54.291
which Lord Krishna has given him.

58
00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:57.583
This verse invites devotees
to Lord Krishna with humility

59
00:02:57.583 --> 00:02:58.708
and faith

60
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:01.208
to come, inviting them.

61
00:03:01.208 --> 00:03:02.833
In this verse it is clear

62
00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:06.583
that true understanding comes
not through intellectual effort

63
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.541
but through Lord Krishna's grace.

64
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:17.416
Have you ever tried to understand

65
00:03:17.416 --> 00:03:21.958
the infinite expanse of the sky?

66
00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:26.500
In life, you experience many things

67
00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:30.041
that you cannot understand.

68
00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:31.500
You wonder

69
00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.291
why certain events happen.

70
00:03:34.291 --> 00:03:37.041
You think why life's

71
00:03:37.041 --> 00:03:40.500
flow is the way it is.

72
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:44.291
Sometimes this lack of understanding

73
00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:47.125
becomes a cause of frustration.

74
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:51.125
For the events that are happening,
you even blame Me.

75
00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:54.291
That much is clear.

76
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:58.291
But can you

77
00:03:58.291 --> 00:04:01.875
Truly understand Me fully?

78
00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:04.083
Know this –

79
00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:05.833
the devas

80
00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:07.833
and the maharishis

81
00:04:07.833 --> 00:04:11.000
who are far more advanced,

82
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.958
even they

83
00:04:12.958 --> 00:04:20.500
cannot fully understand My nature.

84
00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:23.625
A ripe mango has sweetness in it,

85
00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:27.541
but just as the natural sugar that makes it

86
00:04:27.541 --> 00:04:31.875
sweet is invisible,

87
00:04:31.875 --> 00:04:34.541
in the same way My existence's

88
00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:38.666
sweet presence remains in your life,

89
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:41.791
but with its source

90
00:04:41.791 --> 00:04:44.666
you remain unfamiliar.

91
00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:48.458
This is not to discourage you.

92
00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:52.041
It is to remind you to live wisely

93
00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:57.291
on this earth and to remain humble.

94
00:04:57.291 --> 00:05:00.583
Recognising the limits of your understanding

95
00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:03.750
does not make you weak.

96
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:08.666
When you accept that some things

97
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:11.875
are beyond your understanding,

98
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:15.083
then you become free.

99
00:05:15.083 --> 00:05:17.541
The burden of trying to control

100
00:05:17.541 --> 00:05:22.250
everything, you let it go.

101
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.666
Instead of blaming

102
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:26.583
or asking questions,

103
00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:28.625
on trust

104
00:05:28.625 --> 00:05:32.250
and surrender focus your attention.

105
00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:35.541
With humility and faith,

106
00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:38.750
you will find peace even in those situations

107
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.083
that you cannot understand.

108
00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:45.833
Surrender to the unknown

109
00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:49.166
is the first doorway to wisdom,

110
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:50.958
and this is what

111
00:05:50.958 --> 00:05:52.500
will show you

112
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:57.500
the path to becoming one with Me.

113
00:06:02.166 --> 00:06:05.625
In a family, when a child

114
00:06:05.625 --> 00:06:07.708
questions the decisions

115
00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:11.166
of their parents,

116
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.083
they from their limited experience

117
00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:19.791
cannot see the deeper
understanding behind them.

118
00:06:19.791 --> 00:06:21.041
In the same way,

119
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:25.250
in life when something unpleasant happens,

120
00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:29.125
it is easy to blame Me –

121
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:30.833
'God,

122
00:06:30.833 --> 00:06:34.583
why are you letting this happen to us?'

123
00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:38.041
But before blaming,

124
00:06:38.041 --> 00:06:40.750
pause for a moment.

125
00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.500
Have you considered

126
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.041
whether you

127
00:06:45.041 --> 00:06:49.791
can truly understand My plans?

128
00:06:49.791 --> 00:06:54.458
Even the devas and the great rishis

129
00:06:54.458 --> 00:06:57.750
who are far wiser

130
00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.750
My nature

131
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.916
and purpose to fully

132
00:07:01.916 --> 00:07:05.000
understand are unable.

133
00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.000
So

134
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:13.250
how can you understand?

135
00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.000
Just as

136
00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.791
the foundation of a large building –

137
00:07:16.791 --> 00:07:18.458
that is, its base –

138
00:07:18.458 --> 00:07:21.791
is underground and not visible,

139
00:07:21.791 --> 00:07:26.833
yet holds the entire building together,

140
00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:28.541
in the same way

141
00:07:28.541 --> 00:07:32.375
My plans are unseen,

142
00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:35.458
and to your family's wellbeing

143
00:07:35.458 --> 00:07:40.750
they give a solid foundation.

144
00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.000
Blaming Me

145
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.916
to express frustration

146
00:07:44.916 --> 00:07:48.833
may seem like a simple way,

147
00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:50.250
but

148
00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:55.500
it does not bring clarity or a solution.

149
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.291
Instead,

150
00:07:57.291 --> 00:07:59.791
teach your family

151
00:07:59.791 --> 00:08:03.000
to face challenges with humility

152
00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.416
and trust.

153
00:08:05.416 --> 00:08:07.583
Life's difficulties

154
00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:11.333
are part of a larger plan

155
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:14.958
which you cannot see right now.

156
00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:18.291
Just as in a family when a member

157
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:20.208
falls ill,

158
00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:23.875
everyone comes together to care for them.

159
00:08:23.875 --> 00:08:25.791
They unite

160
00:08:25.791 --> 00:08:28.208
and find their strength.

161
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:32.666
Instead of asking why, as a family together

162
00:08:32.666 --> 00:08:35.541
they focus on moving forward.

163
00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:40.458
In the same way, in your
home in every action, trust,

164
00:08:40.458 --> 00:08:42.166
mutual support,

165
00:08:42.166 --> 00:08:44.958
and devotion encourage.

166
00:08:44.958 --> 00:08:48.416
When you turn to Me with trust,

167
00:08:48.416 --> 00:08:51.416
I guide you.

168
00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:53.208
The family in which faith

169
00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:55.958
and surrender are present,

170
00:08:55.958 --> 00:08:59.333
there I reside,

171
00:08:59.333 --> 00:09:02.541
and where I am,

172
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:05.125
there always wellbeing

173
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:07.875
and joy dwell.

174
00:09:12.833 --> 00:09:14.666
Behind great institutions

175
00:09:14.666 --> 00:09:19.666
or organisations there is a deep philosophy,

176
00:09:19.666 --> 00:09:23.250
which takes time to understand.

177
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.833
In the professional world, the founder's vision

178
00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:29.583
can seem unclear to those people

179
00:09:29.583 --> 00:09:32.875
who join the organisation later.

180
00:09:32.875 --> 00:09:36.041
But consider this –

181
00:09:36.041 --> 00:09:38.958
without hearing it from Me directly,

182
00:09:38.958 --> 00:09:43.041
My nature cannot be fully understood.

183
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:46.708
As I said, even the devas

184
00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:52.125
and the great rishis through
their knowledge alone

185
00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:55.958
cannot understand My nature.

186
00:09:55.958 --> 00:09:59.000
In the same way, a founder's vision

187
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.250
comes from special experience
and deep understanding.

188
00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:08.250
That is why with others it must be shared.

189
00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.000
Just as the strings of a veena
each produce different notes,

190
00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:17.125
and a musician brings them
all into one harmony,

191
00:10:17.125 --> 00:10:19.333
in the same way in an organisation

192
00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:23.375
diverse talents can find harmony

193
00:10:23.375 --> 00:10:24.416
only when they

194
00:10:24.416 --> 00:10:28.625
find a skilled leader to bring them together.

195
00:10:28.625 --> 00:10:32.458
As someone working in an organisation,

196
00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:34.750
about the direction or purpose

197
00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:40.541
of your work, do not be
quick to draw conclusions.

198
00:10:40.541 --> 00:10:41.875
Instead,

199
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:45.333
listen to those people's thinking,

200
00:10:45.333 --> 00:10:49.041
who began this work –

201
00:10:49.041 --> 00:10:52.583
try to understand their thinking,

202
00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:55.666
absorb their values.

203
00:10:55.666 --> 00:10:57.416
Just as

204
00:10:57.416 --> 00:11:01.666
a new employee, when they 
understand the organisation's values,

205
00:11:01.666 --> 00:11:05.083
finds their work becoming more meaningful.

206
00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:07.750
They in their every daily task

207
00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:11.541
begin to see the organisation's purpose.

208
00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:16.833
When you take the time
to connect with deeper purpose

209
00:11:16.833 --> 00:11:20.750
then you not only feel more engaged,

210
00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:24.833
you will also contribute more meaningfully.

211
00:11:24.833 --> 00:11:29.083
Those who lead must remember

212
00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:33.083
that behind their actions and decisions

213
00:11:33.083 --> 00:11:37.250
the hidden reasons or purpose, regularly share.

214
00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.208
By sharing the vision, confusion

215
00:11:40.208 --> 00:11:42.958
turns into inspiration.

216
00:11:42.958 --> 00:11:45.916
Work that has deep meaning

217
00:11:45.916 --> 00:11:48.416
and purpose

218
00:11:48.416 --> 00:11:51.375
is no longer just work,

219
00:11:51.375 --> 00:11:54.916
it becomes a sadhana,

220
00:11:54.916 --> 00:11:57.625
and from sadhana

221
00:11:57.625 --> 00:12:00.041
comes siddhi.
